title: "tslens: A PyTorch Framework for Interpreting Time Series Deep Learning Models"
abstract: "SOTA time series interpretability library for PyTorch, from supervised to foundation models. Implements WinTSR and other saliency/attribution methods for explaining time series deep learning predictions."
